<title>BELGIUM: EU needs more information on BA-American deal.</title>
<headline>EU needs more information on BA-American deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Competition Commissioner Karel Van Miert said on Tuesday he was waiting for British Airways and AMR'S American Airlines to provide &quot;supplementary information&quot; on their proposed alliance.</p>
<p>This was on top of written and oral answers given by the two companies to the Commission's objections about the deal, he said in a text released ahead of a speech to the European Parliament.</p>
<p>Only then would the Commission be able to consult national experts of the EU's 15 states before reaching a final decision, Van Miert said. He did not say what additional information he required, nor when the Commission will make a decision.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
